title: "@three-ws/mcp-bridge"
abstract: "MCP stdio bridge that turns any x402-paid HTTP endpoint into a Claude-callable tool. Auto-pays via the @x402 client (EVM exact, SVM exact, EVM batch-settlement) and pre-loads tools from the Coinbase x402 Bazaar."
